==Battleground==
*1 [[Flying Ninja Cat (Enemy)|Flying Ninja Cat]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge]]s spawn after 233.33 seconds<sup>7,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 300 seconds<sup>9,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 366.67 seconds<sup>11,000f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main problem of this stage isn't the boss, but the insanely buffed Doges that come in pairs. There is no need to bring expensive meatshields as they will die in one hit anyways. At least 4 meatshields are recommended due to the Doges' huge pushing power; the crazed cats can help immensely here, mainly [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank]]. Knockback against Floating Enemies is really valuable in this stage as the boss only has 3 knockbacks. [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Recruit]], no matter what level or form, can carry this stage as long as you can stall the boss decently.

